OL,5,G0300 Teleshopping
OL,6,     FShopping from Home.
OL,7,G0610 Inside the Ambulance
OL,8,     FCrews from West Midlands Ambulance
OL,9,     FService attend a diabetic who has
OL,10,     Fcollapsed at home, reassure the
OL,11,     Fwife of a man with heart problems
OL,12,     Fand keep up the spirits of a woman
OL,13,     Fwith womb cancer.
OL,14,G0700 Inside the Ambulance
OL,15,     FThe paramedics treat a young mum
OL,16,     Fwith severe stomach pains, take a
OL,17,     Fbreathless pensioner to hospital
OL,18,     Fand attend an elderly lady with
OL,19,     Fdementia whose nose will not stop
OL,20,     Fbleeding.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/11
